#  h264p's mvs family at level -9: its context indices and its tunable
#  parameters.  IDX/IDX-FORMAT.md is the format; ../../mk.sh regenerates
#  MOD/l9/mvs_h.inc and MOD/l9/mvs_p.inc from this file and mvs.inc.
#
#  Motion: sub_mb_type (kind 0 P, 1 B, as a binary tree), ref_idx (kind 2) and
#  the components of mvd (kind 3; the sign is the mvg family's). comp is the
#  component, lst the list, ma/mb the magnitudes of the components of A and
#  B (classes), oth the class of the other component already coded, ps the
#  partition size (0 16x16 .. 3 4x4), rf the ref_idx of the partition (or of
#  A for ref_idx), pi the partition's place in the macroblock, nr the
#  references of the list; for mvd pd the vector of the same partition in the
#  previous picture of the type (scaled by the POC distance of the
#  partition's reference against that of its own; in B slices the one
#  temporal direct would give, where list 1's first reference has one)
#  less the predicted vector, sp how far the
#  vectors of the neighbours A, B, C are from the predicted one (1 + tc_qlog,
#  0 none), for ref_idx pd the ref_idx in the previous picture; tv for mvd
#  the template match's vector less the predicted one (1 + sq2, 0 none),
#  for ref_idx 1 + the reference it matches best; tq how well it matched
#  (mvd), how much better than on the first reference (ref_idx); rt the
#  texture of the reference (for ref_idx, the first) at the predicted
#  vector (for mvd, across the component), per sample, against the
#  quantizer's step (1 + tc_qlog, 0 none); ea/eb for mvd how far the mvds
#  of A and B were from their template matches' (1 + tc_qlog up to 5, 0
#  none); ta the vector the template search found second best of its
#  starts, less the predicted one (1 + sq2, 0 none).

Prefix H9_mvs
Debug 1
Const 0

Index a
 a_kind: kind, 1!101
 a_comp: comp, 1!1
 a_ma: ma, 1!1110001
 a_mb: mb, 1!1110000
 a_oth: oth, 1!11010
 a_sp: sp, 1!11010001
 a_rt: rt, 1!11001001001001

Index b
 b_kind: kind, 1!001
 b_comp: comp, 1!1
 b_lst: lst, 1!1
 b_ps: ps, 1!111
 b_rf: rf, 1!111
 b_zd: zd, 1!101011111001

Index c
 c_kind: kind, 1!111
 c_comp: comp, 1!1
 c_pd: pd, 1!11110101
 c_sp: sp, 1!00010101
 c_zd: zd, 1!101011001111

Index d
 d_kind: kind, 1!001
 d_comp: comp, 1!0
 d_pd: pd, 1!11101111
 d_ma: ma, 1!0000000
 d_nr: nr, 1!111

Index e
 e_kind: kind, 1!101
 e_comp: comp, 1!0
 e_tv: tv, 1!1111000100011
 e_sp: sp, 1!00000000
 e_rt: rt, 1!11000100110101

Index h
 h_kind: kind, 1!010
 h_comp: comp, 1!1
 h_tv: tv, 1!0100000000000
 h_oth: oth, 1!11111
 h_tq: tq, 1!101101011001
 h_ea: ea, 1!100101
 h_eb: eb, 1!100000

Index i
 i_kind: kind, 1!111
 i_comp: comp, 1!1
 i_tv: tv, 1!1000010000010
 i_tq: tq, 1!010000100001
 i_zd: zd, 1!101100001000
 i_ta: ta, 1!1000011101001

Index j
 j_kind: kind, 1!111
 j_comp: comp, 1!0
 j_ma: ma, 1!0011100
 j_mb: mb, 1!1111100
 j_cq: cq, 1!000000000

Index k
 k_kind: kind, 1!011
 k_comp: comp, 1!0
 k_pd: pd, 1!11110110
 k_sp: sp, 1!01101001
 k_ps: ps, 1!111

Index l
 l_kind: kind, 1!111
 l_comp: comp, 1!1
 l_oth: oth, 1!10001
 l_tv: tv, 1!0000000000000
 l_rf: rf, 1!000

Index s
 s_kind: kind, 1!111
 s_comp: comp, 1!1
 s_tv: tv, 1!0000000001001

Index f
 f_kind: kind, 1!111
 f_comp: comp, 1!0
 f_sp: sp, 1!10100010
 f_cq: cq, 1!110110001

Index m
 m_kind: kind, 1!000
 m_comp: comp, 1!0
 m_pd: pd, 1!11001

Index w
 w_kind: kind, 1!111
 w_comp: comp, 1!0
 w_pd: pd, 1!00000001
 w_ma: ma, 1!1101000
 w_nr: nr, 1!011

Index t
 t_kind: kind, 1!001
 t_comp: comp, 1!1

Index n
 n_kind: kind, 1!000

Index g
 g_kind: kind, 1!000
 g_ma: ma, 1!0
 g_oth: oth, 1!0

Number rA, 1, 0!11111111
Number rB, 1, 0!00000000
Number rC, 1, 0!11111100
Number rE, 1, 0!11111111
Number rH, 1, 0!11111111
Number rI, 1, 0!11011010
Number rJ, 1, 0!10110001
Number rK, 1, 0!11100101
Number rL, 1, 0!01100010
Number rD, 1, 0!11111001
Number rT, 1, 0!00011100
Number rG, 1, 0!00000000
Number rS1, 1, 0!01000
Number rS2, 1, 0!00111
Number lr, 1, 0!01111
Number lrm, 1, 0!11111
Number mbm, 1, 0!00100010
Number mwA, 1, 0!00001001
Number mwB, 1, 0!10000000
Number mwC, 1, 0!00000101
Number mwE, 1, 0!00000011
Number mwH, 1, 0!00001110
Number mwI, 1, 0!00000110
Number mwJ, 1, 0!01000000
Number mwK, 1, 0!00111001
Number mwL, 1, 0!00001110
Number mwD, 1, 0!00100101
Number mwT, 1, 0!00001001
Number mwG, 1, 0!00000000
Number bw, 1, 0!01100
Number mt, 1, 0!110
Number qs, 1, 3!1110110
Number qf, 1, 3!0011110
Number mb, 1, 0!00101101

#  Rows per table, as log2: a table whose index Volume fits in 2^h rows is
#  direct, one that does not is hashed into 2^h rows and contexts share
#  them.  31 is "never hashed".  Frozen: left live these only grow.
! Number hA, 1, 0!10000
! Number hB, 1, 0!11000
! Number hC, 1, 0!11000
! Number hE, 1, 0!11000
! Number hH, 1, 0!10000
! Number hI, 1, 0!11000
! Number hJ, 1, 0!11000
! Number hK, 1, 0!11000
! Number hL, 1, 0!11000
! Number hD, 1, 0!11000
! Number hS, 1, 0!11000
! Number hF, 1, 0!11000
! Number hM, 1, 0!11000
! Number hT, 1, 0!11000
! Number hN, 1, 0!11000
